question:
IAM策略已附加到IAM用户组。这是应用于该用户组的唯一策略。
{
    "Version": "2012-10-17", 
    "statement": [
        {
            "Sid": "1", 
            "Effect": "Allow", 
            "Action": "ec2:*", 
            "Resource": "*", 
            "Condition": {
                "StringEquals": {
                    "ec2:Region": "us-east-1"
                }
            }
        }, 
        {
            "sid": "2", 
            "Effect": "Deny", 
            "Action": [
                "ec2:StopInstances", 
                "ec2:TerminateInstances"
            ], 
            "Resource": "*", 
            "Condition": {
                "BoolIfExists": {
                    "aws:MultiFactorAuthPresent": false
                }
            }
        }
    ]
}
这个策略对用户组成员的有效IAM权限是什么？
